    {
      "id": "p0240-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Despite his laid-back attitude throughout the game, it turns out that Sans is extremely powerful. In fact, Sans is so difficult to fight that it usually takes players dozens of attempts to defeat him. Sometimes, the battle is so tough that some players just give up entirely.",
        "raw": "Despite his laid-back attitude throughout the game, it turns out that Sans is\nextremely powerful. In fact, Sans is so difficult to fight that it usually takes\nplayers dozens of attempts to defeat him. Sometimes, the battle is so tough that\nsome players just give up entirely.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29510849,
          0.31562143,
          0.89852945,
          0.38319286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29260551,
          0.31490714,
          0.90650453,
          0.38426429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          11,
          12,
          13,
          14
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Sans 虽然一路都懒懒散散，实力却极其强大。事实上，他难打到玩家通常要尝试几十次才能取胜。有时战斗太难，甚至有人干脆彻底放弃。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
