    {
      "id": "p0240-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This battle with Sans is memorable, epic, and frustrating, so his casual question has become one of the most famous lines in the game. As such, \"do you wanna have a bad time\" has spawned countless English-language fan drawings, videos, and meme images over the years.",
        "raw": "This battle with Sans is memorable, epic, and frustrating, so his casual question\nhas become one of the most famous lines in the game. As such, \"do you wanna\nhave a bad time\" has spawned countless English-language fan drawings, videos,\nand meme images over the years.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29597997,
          0.5714,
          0.90447783,
          0.63832143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29260551,
          0.57068571,
          0.90650453,
          0.63939286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这场 Sans 战气势十足、令人难忘，也令人抓狂，于是他这句随口的问话成了游戏最著名的台词之一。多年来，“do you wanna have a bad time”催生了无数英语圈同人画、视频和梗图。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
