    {
      "id": "p0240-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Naturally, Toby commented on this line's importance and worked with the localization team to get it just right. Because Sans' English line isn't technically a direct threat, the Japanese line needed to achieve a similar \"you have to read between the lines\" effect. Eventually, the team settled on a relatively straightforward translation:",
        "raw": "Naturally, Toby commented on this line's importance and worked with the\nlocalization team to get it just right. Because Sans' English line isn't technically\na direct threat, the Japanese line needed to achieve a similar \"you have to\nread between the lines\" effect. Eventually, the team settled on a relatively\nstraightforward translation:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.297652,
          0.65275,
          0.90010014,
          0.73916429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29260551,
          0.65203571,
          0.90650453,
          0.74023571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          25,
          26,
          27,
          28,
          29
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 自然也特地说明了这句的重要性，与本地化团队一同斟酌。严格说来，Sans 的英文台词并非直接威胁，日文也要让玩家自己听出弦外之音。团队最后采用了比较直接的译法：",
