    {
      "id": "p0240-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This final Japanese line conveys everything found in the English line, but rolls off the tongue differently. Even so, Japanese fans do quote the line regularly, although it's usually only the saiaku name (\"terrible time\") portion rather than the full quote itself.",
        "raw": "This final Japanese line conveys everything found in the English line, but rolls\noff the tongue differently. Even so, Japanese fans do quote the line regularly,\nalthough it's usually only the saiaku name (\"terrible time\") portion rather than\nthe full quote itself.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
